# Check out and commit every text file with LF, whatever core.autocrlf says: Prettier writes LF,
# and the app is built and run on Linux. Without this, Windows checkouts mix CRLF and LF and
# files show up as modified with no real change.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.webp binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.wav binary
*.woff2 binary
